{"3392410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Airship Combat", "steam_appid": 3392410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command a heavily armed air battleship and fight wave after wave of relentless enemies in several different game modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392410/extras/2f4f4904049d07fde9c0e662b3dfbf44.avif?t=1787178854\" width=600 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Direct your fighting airship to shell targets at long range or fire a devastating salvo of high damage torpedoes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392410/extras/5d2e646ac0435632f7ad43a804aaec7e.poster.avif?t=1787178854\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392410/extras/5d2e646ac0435632f7ad43a804aaec7e.webm?t=1787178854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392410/extras/5d2e646ac0435632f7ad43a804aaec7e.mp4?t=1787178854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For other targets, launch guided missiles and watch them homing in on their prey while dodging coming rounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your ship with better performance, durability and, best of all, improved turrets and exotic weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392410/extras/02490a2d67f22136d28a138a1a0c4c3a.avif?t=1787178854\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command a heavily armed air battleship and fight wave after wave of relentless enemies in several different game modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392410/extras/2f4f4904049d07fde9c0e662b3dfbf44.avif?t=1787178854\" width=600 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Direct your fighting airship to shell targets at long range or fire a devastating salvo of high damage torpedoes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392410/extras/5d2e646ac0435632f7ad43a804aaec7e.poster.avif?t=1787178854\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392410/extras/5d2e646ac0435632f7ad43a804aaec7e.webm?t=1787178854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392410/extras/5d2e646ac0435632f7ad43a804aaec7e.mp4?t=1787178854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For other targets, launch guided missiles and watch them homing in on their prey while dodging coming rounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your ship with better performance, durability and, best of all, improved turrets and exotic weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392410/extras/02490a2d67f22136d28a138a1a0c4c3a.avif?t=1787178854\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Airship Combat is a 3d simulator with realistic physics and challenging opponents. Fire guided missiles, flying torpedoes and of course guns. After the battle, swap turrets and upg